        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Swirl and Echo\n\nRuns audio through a sweeping phaser and then a feedback delay. Both effects blend with the dry signal, so the original sound stays audible underneath.\n\n**How it works:** \"Audio\" takes your file. \"Phaser\" sweeps at 0.6 Hz around 1000 Hz at a 0.5 mix. \"Delay\" adds 0.33-second echoes with 0.35 feedback at a 0.4 mix, and \"Result\" returns the treated audio.\n\n**Try this:** Set delay_seconds on \"Delay\" to match your track's tempo, for example 0.5 for a quarter note at 120 BPM."
        },
